![](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/4d8b984d-925f-44bf-9438-854f5ecfc864.png)

Set the toolchain to **[MCU ARM GCC]** and select the **[STM32H7S7L8HxH]** MCU**.**

![](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/a8b0fa12-bbfb-4d18-9779-a1b9be67ac42.png)

