![](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/d9cc1dbb-924c-406b-b56a-ea447025a4d6.png)

```

#define USBH_DEBUG_LEVEL      2U

```

Also in the same file, modify the **USBH\_MAX\_SIZE\_CONFIGURATION**definition to 512U to support audio enumeration.

```

#define   USBH_MAX_SIZE_CONFIGURATION      512U

```

Go to main.c in the **[Appli]** section to add the configuration related to redefining **USBH\_UsrLog** for VCOM connected to UART4.

3.**UART configuration**

```

defined(__GNUC__)

